          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Mentoring juniors means helping them learn faster by sharing context, setting clear expectations, giving specific feedback and letting them make decisions safely, and it is a skill that supports promotion into lead and manager roles."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Agree goals and meeting rhythm with the junior, give examples instead of vague advice, and review progress together."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Follow your employer's policies on feedback, confidentiality and fair treatment."
          }
        ]
      },
